### get Tag
GET {{host}}/api/v3/projects/{{newProject}}/tags/Page

### get tagtypes
GET {{host}}/api/v3/projects/tagtypes

### DELETE Tag
DELETE {{host}}/api/v3/projects/{{project}}/tags/PAGE_PAGE_票券列表
Authorization: {{token1}}


### Add Tag
PATCH {{host}}/api/v3/modules/{{moduleId}}/translations/{{key}}/tags/add
content-type: application/json
Authorization: {{token1}}

{
    "tags": [
        {
            "tag": "{{tag}}"
        }
    ]
}